msgid "Basis input"
msgstr "基组输入"

msgid "Overview: sets and the basis library"
msgstr "概述：集合与基组库"

msgid ""
"The basis sets may either be taken from the library, or may be specified "
"explicitly, or any combination. Optionally, the basis function type can be "
"chosen using the ``CARTESIAN`` or ``SPHERICAL`` commands."
msgstr ""
"基组可以从库中获取，也可以显式指定，或者两者结合使用。可选地，可以使用 ``CARTESIAN`` 或 ``SPHERICAL`` 命令选择基函数类型。"

msgid "Cartesian and spherical harmonic basis functions"
msgstr "笛卡尔与球谐函数基函数"

msgid "[command:spherical]"
msgstr "[command:spherical]"

msgid ""
"``MOLPRO`` uses spherical harmonics (:math:`5d`, :math:`7f`, etc) by "
"default, even for Pople basis sets like ``6-31G**``. This behaviour may be "
"different to that of other programs; However, cartesian functions can be "
"requested using the ``CARTESIAN`` command."
msgstr ""
"``MOLPRO`` 默认使用球谐函数（\\ :math:`5d`\\ 、\\ :math:`7f` 等），即使对于像 ``6-31G**`` 这样的 "
"Pople 基组也是如此。此行为可能与其他程序不同；但是，可以使用 ``CARTESIAN`` 命令请求笛卡尔函数。"

msgid "``CARTESIAN``"
msgstr "``CARTESIAN``"

msgid ""
"If this command is encountered, the logical ``MOLPRO`` variable "
"``CARTESIAN`` is set to true (1.0), and all subsequent calculations use "
"cartesian basis functions. This is remembered across restarts. One can "
"switch back to spherical harmonics using the command."
msgstr ""
"如果遇到此命令，逻辑型 ``MOLPRO`` 变量 ``CARTESIAN`` "
"将被设为真（1.0），并且所有后续计算都将使用笛卡尔基函数。此设置在重启后仍会保留。可以使用以下命令切换回球谐函数。"

msgid "``SPHERICAL``"
msgstr "``SPHERICAL``"

msgid ""
"It should be noted that there are the following disadvantages and "
"limitations when using cartesian basis functions:"
msgstr "需要注意的是，使用笛卡尔基函数存在以下缺点和限制："

msgid ""
"Since Molpro 2022.2 all auxiliary basis sets (e.g. for density fitting or "
"RI) use spherical functions by default, independent of the ``CARTESIAN`` "
"setting. Cartesian auxiliary functions can be used by defining the basis "
"sets in a basis block using, e.g.,"
msgstr ""
"自 Molpro 2022.2 起，所有辅助基组（例如用于密度拟合或 RI 的）默认使用球谐函数，与 ``CARTESIAN`` "
"设置无关。可以通过在基组块中定义基组来使用笛卡尔辅助函数，例如，"

msgid ""
"but this is not recommended since such sets become often linearly dependent."
msgstr "但不推荐这样做，因为此类基组常常会变得线性相关。"

msgid "The basis set library"
msgstr "基组库"

msgid ""
"The basis set library consists of a set of plain text files that constitute "
"a database of commonly-used basis sets (primitive gaussians and associated "
"contractions) and effective core potentials. These files can be found in the"
" source tree as ``lib/*.libmol``."
msgstr ""
"基组库由一组纯文本文件构成，这些文件构成了常用基组（原始高斯函数及关联收缩）和有效芯势的数据库。这些文件可在源代码树中的 "
"``lib/*.libmol`` 找到。"

msgid "Default basis sets"
msgstr "默认基组"

msgid ""
"If a basis is not specified at all for any unique atom group, then the "
"program assumes a global default. Presently, this default is ``VDZ``, but "
"may be overridden using"
msgstr "如果未为任何独特的原子组指定基组，则程序采用全局默认值。目前，此默认值为 ``VDZ``\\ ，但可通过以下方式覆盖："

msgid "or"
msgstr "或"

msgid ""
"*basis* is looked up in the file ``lib/defbas``, which generates an "
"appropriate request for a complete contracted set, together in some cases "
"with an ECP, from the library. This mapping includes the following commonly-"
"used basis sets:"
msgstr ""
"*basis* 在文件 ``lib/defbas`` "
"中查找，该文件会从库中生成一个完整收缩基组的适当请求，有时还附带一个ECP。此映射包含以下常用基组："

msgid ""
"All of the Dunning correlation consistent basis sets, through the use of "
"either the standard name of the basis set (``cc-pVXZ``, ``aug-cc-pVXZ``) or "
"an abbreviation (``VXZ``, ``AVXZ``). For Al-Ar the tight-d augmented sets "
"are obtained through the standard name ``cc-pV(X+d)Z``, ``aug-cc-pV(X+d)Z`` "
"or ``VXZ+d``, ``AVXZ+d``. Sets X=D,T,Q,5 are available for H-Kr with X=6 "
"available for B-Ne and Al-Ar."
msgstr ""
"所有Dunning相关一致基组，通过使用基组的标准名称（\\ ``cc-pVXZ``\\ 、\\ ``aug-cc-pVXZ``\\ ）或缩写（\\ "
"``VXZ``\\ 、\\ ``AVXZ``\\ ）均可获得。对于Al-Ar，紧致d轨道增强基组可通过标准名称 ``cc-pV(X+d)Z``\\ "
"、\\ ``aug-cc-pV(X+d)Z`` 或缩写 ``VXZ+d``\\ 、\\ ``AVXZ+d`` 获得。X=D,T,Q,5的基组适用于H-"
"Kr，而X=6的基组适用于B-Ne和Al-Ar。"

msgid ""
"The correlation consistent basis sets for core correlation, ``cc-pCVXZ``, "
"``aug-cc-pCVXZ`` or ``CVXZ``, ``ACVXZ`` (X=D,T,Q,5), and the newer ”weighted"
" sets” ``cc-pwCVXZ``, ``aug-cc-pwCVXZ`` or ``WCVXZ``, ``AWCVXZ`` "
"(X=D,T,Q,5). These are available for Li-Kr (CVXZ do not include Sc-Zn)."
msgstr ""
"用于芯层相关的相关一致基组，\\ ``cc-pCVXZ``\\ 、\\ ``aug-cc-pCVXZ`` 或缩写 ``CVXZ``\\ 、\\ "
"``ACVXZ``\\ （X=D,T,Q,5），以及较新的“加权基组” ``cc-pwCVXZ``\\ 、\\ ``aug-cc-pwCVXZ`` "
"或缩写 ``WCVXZ``\\ 、\\ ``AWCVXZ``\\ （X=D,T,Q,5）。这些基组适用于Li-Kr（CVXZ不包括Sc-Zn）。"

msgid ""
"Douglas-Kroll-Hess relativistic versions of the correlation consistent basis"
" sets are available through use of the standard or abbreviated names with "
"extension -DK, e.g., ``cc-pVXZ-DK`` or ``VXZ-DK`` (2nd-order DKH). X=D-5 are"
" available for H-Kr, while X=T are available for Y-Cd and Hf-Hg, X=D,T,Q for"
" In-Xe, Tl-Rn, K-Ca, and Rb-Sr. Sets contracted for 3rd-order DKH with "
"extension -DK3 are available for Hf-Hg (X=T) and X=D,T,Q for In-Xe, Tl-Rn, "
"La-Lu, Ac-Lr, Cs-Ba, and Fr-Ra. Most of these sets have also been contracted"
" for the eXact-2-Component (X2C) Hamiltonian as detailed below."
msgstr ""
"相关一致基组的Douglas-Kroll-Hess相对论版本可通过使用带有-DK扩展的标准名称或缩写名称获得，例如 ``cc-pVXZ-DK`` 或 "
"``VXZ-DK``\\ （二阶DKH）。X=D-5的基组适用于H-Kr，而X=T的基组适用于Y-Cd和Hf-Hg，X=D,T,Q的基组适用于In-"
"Xe、Tl-Rn、K-Ca和Rb-Sr。为三阶DKH收缩的基组带有-DK3扩展，适用于Hf-Hg（X=T）以及X=D,T,Q的In-Xe、Tl-"
"Rn、La-Lu、Ac-Lr、Cs-Ba和Fr-Ra。这些基组中的大多数也已为精确二分量（X2C）哈密顿量进行了收缩，详见下文。"

msgid ""
"The F12 basis sets of Peterson and co-workers for explicitly correlated "
"calculations, ``cc-pVXZ-F12``, ``cc-pCVXZ-F12`` or ``VXZ-F12``, ``CVXZ-F12``"
" with X=D,T,Q are available for H-Ar, while ``cc-pVXZ-PP-F12`` or ``VXZ-"
"PP-F12`` with X=D,T,Q are available for Cu-Kr, Ag-Xe, and Au-Rn."
msgstr ""
"用于显式相关计算的Peterson及其同事的F12基组，\\ ``cc-pVXZ-F12``\\ 、\\ ``cc-pCVXZ-F12`` 或缩写 "
"``VXZ-F12``\\ 、\\ ``CVXZ-F12``\\ （X=D,T,Q）适用于H-Ar，而 ``cc-pVXZ-PP-F12`` 或缩写 "
"``VXZ-PP-F12``\\ （X=D,T,Q）适用于Cu-Kr、Ag-Xe和Au-Rn。"

msgid ""
"The Turbomole def2 family of basis sets, ``SV(P)``, ``SVP``, ``TZVP``, "
"``TZVPP``, ``QZVP``, and ``QZVPP``. These are available for the entire "
"periodic table except for the f-block elements."
msgstr ""
"Turbomole def2系列基组，\\ ``SV(P)``\\ 、\\ ``SVP``\\ 、\\ ``TZVP``\\ 、\\ "
"``TZVPP``\\ 、\\ ``QZVP`` 和 ``QZVPP``\\ 。这些基组适用于除f区元素外的整个周期表。"

msgid ""
"The older segmented Dunning/Hay double-zeta sets for the first row (``DZ`` "
"and ``DZP``)."
msgstr "较旧的、用于第一行元素的Dunning/Hay分段双zeta基组（\\ ``DZ`` 和 ``DZP``\\ ）。"

msgid "The Roos ANO basis sets for H-Ar (``ROOS``)."
msgstr "适用于 H-Ar 的 Roos ANO 基组（\\ ``ROOS``\\ ）。"

msgid ""
"The Stuttgart ECPs and associated basis sets (e.g., ``ECP10MDF``), as well "
"as the ECP-based correlation consistent basis sets of Peterson and co-"
"workers, ``cc-pVXZ-PP``, ``aug-cc-pVXZ-PP``, ``cc-pwCVXZ-PP``, ``aug-cc-"
"pwCVXZ-PP`` or ``VXZ-PP``, ``AVXZ-PP``, ``WCVXZ-PP``, ``AWCVXZ-PP``. The "
"latter are available for Cu-Kr, Y-Xe, and Hf-Rn (core correlation sets "
"currently only for transition metals)."
msgstr ""
"Stuttgart 赝势及相关基组（例如 ``ECP10MDF``\\ ），以及 Peterson 与合作者基于赝势的相关一致性基组，\\ ``cc-"
"pVXZ-PP``\\ 、\\ ``aug-cc-pVXZ-PP``\\ 、\\ ``cc-pwCVXZ-PP``\\ 、\\ ``aug-cc-"
"pwCVXZ-PP`` 或 ``VXZ-PP``\\ 、\\ ``AVXZ-PP``\\ 、\\ ``WCVXZ-PP``\\ 、\\ "
"``AWCVXZ-PP``\\ 。后者适用于 Cu-Kr、Y-Xe 和 Hf-Rn（芯层相关基组目前仅适用于过渡金属）。"

msgid "The Hay ECPs and corresponding basis sets (``ECP1`` and ``ECP2``)."
msgstr "Hay 赝势及相应基组（\\ ``ECP1`` 和 ``ECP2``\\ ）。"

msgid ""
"Other members of the Karlsruhe basis sets (``SV``, ``TZV``, and, for some "
"elements, ``TZVPPP``)."
msgstr "Karlsruhe 基组的其他成员（\\ ``SV``\\ 、\\ ``TZV``\\ ，以及针对某些元素的 ``TZVPPP``\\ ）。"

msgid ""
"Most of the Pople basis sets, using their standard names (e.g., ``6-31G*, "
"6-311++G(D,P)``, etc.). Note that specially in this case, the mechanism "
"described below using parenthesized modifiers to restrict the basis set is "
"disabled to allow the full range of standard basis sets to be specified."
msgstr ""
"大多数Pople基组，使用其标准名称（例如，\\ ``6-31G*, 6-311++G(D,P)``\\ "
"等）。请注意，特别是在这种情况下，下文描述的用于限制基组的带括号修饰符机制被禁用，以便允许指定完整的标准基组范围。"

msgid ""
"Short names for the available correlation-consistent default basis sets with"
" ``X=D|T|Q|5`` are listed in the following table. Augmented sets are as non-"
"augmented and therefore not listed. The short names of augmented sets have "
"prefix ``a``, ``da``, ``ta``, for singly, doubly, or triply augmented sets, "
"e.g. ``avtz``. Note that not all cardinal numbers may be available for each "
"Z."
msgstr ""
"以下表格列出了可用的相关一致默认基组的短名称，其中\\ ``X=D|T|Q|5``\\ "
"。增广基组与非增广基组相同，因此未列出。增广基组的短名称带有前缀\\ ``a``\\ 、\\ ``da``\\ 、\\ ``ta``\\ "
"，分别表示单增广、双增广或三增广基组，例如\\ ``avtz``\\ 。请注意，并非所有基数都适用于每个原子序数Z。"

