msgid ""
"In addition, many density fitting and resolution of the identity (RI) basis "
"sets are available. For the correlation consistent basis sets of Dunning, "
"the appropriate VXZ/JKFIT, VXZ/MP2FIT, AVXZ/MP2FIT sets of Weigend are "
"chosen automatically in density fitted calculations (augmented versions "
"AVXZ/JKFIT for Fock-matrix fitting are also available). For the def2 family "
"of orbital basis sets, the appropriate auxiliary sets (e.g., TZVPP/JFIT, "
"TZVPP/JKFIT, TZVPP/MP2FIT) are used. In principle these JKFIT sets are "
"universal and also applicable in combination with the AVXZ basis sets. "
"Initial results indicate that they also work well with the cc-pVXZ-PP and "
"aug-cc-pVXZ-PP series of basis sets."
msgstr ""
"此外，还提供了许多密度拟合和分辨率恒等（RI）基组。对于Dunning的相关一致基组，在密度拟合计算中会自动选择Weigend的相应VXZ/JKFIT、VXZ/MP2FIT、AVXZ/MP2FIT基组（用于Fock矩阵拟合的增强版本AVXZ/JKFIT也可用）。对于def2系列的轨道基组，则使用相应的辅助基组（例如，TZVPP/JFIT、TZVPP/JKFIT、TZVPP/MP2FIT）。原则上，这些JKFIT基组是通用的，也可与AVXZ基组结合使用。初步结果表明，它们与cc-"
"pVXZ-PP和aug-cc-pVXZ-PP系列基组也能良好配合。"

msgid ""
"For explicitly correlated F12 calculations that use the cc-pVXZ-F12 or cc-"
"pVXZ-PP-F12 orbital basis sets, the corresponding VXZ-F12/OPTRI or VXZ-"
"PP-F12/OPTRI basis sets are used by default to construct the complementary "
"auxiliary orbital basis (CABS). For other orbital basis sets, appropriate "
"JKFIT sets are utilized by default."
msgstr ""
"对于使用cc-pVXZ-F12或cc-pVXZ-PP-F12轨道基组的显式相关F12计算，默认使用相应的VXZ-F12/OPTRI或VXZ-"
"PP-F12/OPTRI基组来构建互补辅助轨道基组（CABS）。对于其他轨道基组，默认使用适当的JKFIT基组。"

msgid "Example:"
msgstr "示例："

msgid "``BASIS=VTZ``"
msgstr "``BASIS=VTZ``"

msgid "generates valence triple zeta basis set for all atoms. Thus, the input"
msgstr "为所有原子生成价层三重zeta基组。因此，输入"

msgid ""
"performs a Hartree-Fock calculation for H\\ :math:`_2`\\ O using the cc-pVTZ"
" basis set."
msgstr "使用cc-pVTZ基组对H\\ :math:`_2`\\ O执行Hartree-Fock计算。"

msgid ""
"Default basis sets can be defined anywhere in the input before the energy "
"calculation to which it should apply using a single ``BASIS`` card as shown "
"above. The default basis set applies to all types of atoms but can be "
"superceded by different basis sets for specific atoms as explained in the "
"next section. Some restrictions concerning the maximum angular momentum "
"functions to be used, or the number of contracted functions are possible as "
"follows:"
msgstr ""
"默认基组可以在输入中能量计算之前的任何位置定义，使用如上所示的单个\\ ``BASIS``\\ "
"卡片，该默认基组将应用于该能量计算。默认基组适用于所有类型的原子，但可以被特定原子的不同基组覆盖，如下一节所述。可以施加一些关于要使用的最大角动量函数或收缩函数数量的限制，如下所示："

msgid ""
"The maximum angular momentum in the basis set can be reduced using syntax "
"such as"
msgstr "可以使用如下语法减少基组中的最大角动量"

msgid "``BASIS,VQZ(D)``"
msgstr "``BASIS,VQZ(D)``"

msgid ""
"which would omit the :math:`f` and :math:`g` functions that would normally "
"be present in the VQZ basis set."
msgstr "这将省略VQZ基组中通常存在的\\ :math:`f`\\ 和\\ :math:`g`\\ 函数。"

msgid "``BASIS,VQZ(D/P)``"
msgstr "``BASIS,VQZ(D/P)``"

msgid ""
"would specify additionally a maximum angular momentum of :math:`1` on "
"hydrogen, i.e. would omit :math:`d` orbitals on hydrogen."
msgstr "将额外指定氢原子的最大角动量为 :math:`1`\\ ，即省略氢原子上的 :math:`d` 轨道。"

msgid ""
"For generally contracted basis sets, an extended syntax can be used to "
"explicitly give the number of contracted functions of each angular momentum."
" For example,"
msgstr "对于广义收缩基组，可以使用扩展语法来明确指定每个角动量的收缩函数数量。例如，"

msgid "``BASIS,ROOS(3s2p1d/2s)``"
msgstr "``BASIS,ROOS(3s2p1d/2s)``"

msgid "generates a ``6-31G*``-sized basis set from the Roos ANO compilation."
msgstr "从 Roos ANO 汇编中生成一个 ``6-31G*`` 大小的基组。"

msgid ""
"Notes: *basis* must not be variable called BASIS. Furthermore, input like"
msgstr "注意：\\ *basis* 不能是名为 BASIS 的变量。此外，像"

msgid "``$BASIS=[AVDZ, AVTZ, AVQZ]``"
msgstr "``$BASIS=[AVDZ, AVTZ, AVQZ]``"

msgid ""
"is not allowed, i.e. the keyword ``BASIS`` must not be preceded with $. One "
"can loop over several basis sets using, for example, using"
msgstr "是不允许的，即关键字 ``BASIS`` 前面不能加 $。可以使用，例如，使用以下方式来循环多个基组："

msgid "Default basis sets for individual atoms"
msgstr "单个原子的默认基组"

msgid ""
"Different default basis sets for individual atoms can be specified with one-"
"line ``BASIS`` commands by adding after the default basis *atom1=name1, "
"atom2=name2,…*, where *atomi* are the chemical symbols, and *namei* are the "
"associated basis set names. The name conventions for the atom specific basis"
" sets work exactly as described above for default basis sets. Examples:"
msgstr ""
"可以通过在默认基组后添加 *atom1=name1, atom2=name2,…* 来使用单行 ``BASIS`` "
"命令为单个原子指定不同的默认基组，其中 *atomi* 是化学符号，\\ *namei* "
"是关联的基组名称。原子特定基组的命名约定与上述默认基组的描述完全相同。例如："

msgid "``basis=vtz,h=vdz``"
msgstr "``basis=vtz,h=vdz``"

msgid ""
"uses cc-pVTZ as a general default, but for hydrogen atoms cc-pVDZ is used."
msgstr "使用 cc-pVTZ 作为通用默认基组，但对于氢原子则使用 cc-pVDZ。"

msgid "``basis,vtz,h=vdz``"
msgstr "``basis,vtz,h=vdz``"

msgid "``basis,default=vtz,h=vdz``"
msgstr "``basis,default=vtz,h=vdz``"

msgid ""
"are equivalent to the above. Note that the default basis has to be specified"
" before any atom specific sets."
msgstr "与上述内容等效。请注意，必须在任何原子特定基组之前指定默认基组。"

msgid ""
"Since Molpro2024.2 one can also define basis sets for ranges of atoms. The "
"range is given as atom1-atom2, where Z(atom2)>Z(atom1), for example"
msgstr ""
"自 Molpro2024.2 起，也可以为原子范围定义基组。范围以 atom1-atom2 的形式给出，其中 Z(atom2)>Z(atom1)，例如"

msgid "Basis blocks"
msgstr "基组块"

msgid ""
"More specific basis set definitions for individual atoms can be given in "
"``BASIS`` input blocks, which have the following general form:"
msgstr "针对单个原子的更具体的基组定义可以在 ``BASIS`` 输入块中给出，其一般形式如下："

msgid ""
"Instead of the ``BASIS`` …\\ ``END`` block one can also use the structure "
"``BASIS={…}``"
msgstr "除了 ``BASIS`` …\\ ``END`` 块之外，也可以使用结构 ``BASIS={…}``"

msgid ""
"Any number of basis sets can be be given in a basis block. The definition of"
" each basis set is started by a ``SET`` directive, on which the name of the "
"basis and further options can be specified."
msgstr "一个基组块中可以给出任意数量的基组。每个基组的定义由一个 ``SET`` 指令开始，在该指令上可以指定基组的名称和进一步的选项。"

msgid ""
"By default, the first set in a basis block is the orbital basis, and in this"
" case the directive ``SET,ORBITAL`` can be omitted."
msgstr "默认情况下，基组块中的第一个集合是轨道基组，在这种情况下可以省略指令 ``SET,ORBITAL``\\ 。"

msgid ""
"``DEFAULT`` specifies the default basis set, exactly as on one line basis "
"input. It can be followed by specifications for individual atoms, e.g. "
"O=AVTZ. The default and atom specifications can also be merged to one line, "
"separated by commas, e.g."
msgstr ""
"``DEFAULT`` 指定默认基组，与单行基组输入中的方式完全相同。其后可以跟对单个原子的指定，例如 "
"O=AVTZ。默认值和原子指定也可以合并到一行，用逗号分隔，例如"

msgid "``DEFAULT=VTZ,O=AVTZ,H=VDZ``"
msgstr "``DEFAULT=VTZ,O=AVTZ,H=VDZ``"

msgid ""
"Here the basis sets ``AVTZ``, ``VDZ`` overwrite the default basis set VTZ "
"for the atoms O and H, respectively. This is exactly as described in section"
" `default basis sets for individual atoms <basis_input.html#default-basis-"
"sets-for-individual-atoms>`__ for one-line basis inputs."
msgstr ""
"此处，基组 ``AVTZ``\\ 、\\ ``VDZ`` 分别覆盖了原子 O 和 H 的默认基组 VTZ。这与 `default basis sets "
"for individual atoms <basis_input.html#default-basis-sets-for-individual-"
"atoms>`__ 一节中针对单行基组输入所描述的情况完全相同。"

msgid ""
"The specifications ``SET``, ``DEFAULT``, ``atom=name`` are all optional. If "
"``DEFAULT`` is not given, the previous default, as specified on the last "
"previous ``BASIS`` card, is used."
msgstr ""
"规范 ``SET``\\ 、\\ ``DEFAULT``\\ 、\\ ``atom=name`` 都是可选的。如果未给出 ``DEFAULT``\\ "
"，则使用上一个 ``BASIS`` 卡片中指定的先前默认值。"

msgid ""
"Several ``BASIS`` cards and/or blocks can immediately follow each other. "
"Always the last specification for a given atom and setname is used (the "
"default setname is ``ORBITAL``)."
msgstr ""
"多个 ``BASIS`` 卡片和/或块可以紧接在一起。对于给定的原子和集合名称，总是使用最后一个规范（默认的集合名称是 ``ORBITAL``\\ ）。"

msgid ""
"If a basis is not specified at all for any unique atom group, then the "
"program assumes VDZ."
msgstr "如果对于任何唯一的原子组完全没有指定基组，则程序假定为 VDZ。"

msgid "``DF-HF,BASIS=JK``"
msgstr "``DF-HF,BASIS=JK``"

msgid "in order to use the auxiliary basis in DF-HF."
msgstr "以便在 DF-HF 中使用辅助基组。"

msgid "Auxiliary basis sets for density fitting or resolution of the identity"
msgstr "用于密度拟合或分辨率恒等的辅助基组"

msgid ""
"As described in the previous section, several basis sets can be defined in a"
" basis block. The definition of each basis starts with a line"
msgstr "如前一节所述，可以在一个基组块中定义多个基组。每个基组的定义以一行开始"

msgid "is equivalent to"
msgstr "等同于"

msgid ""
"Optionally, the basis function type ``CARTESIAN`` (6d, 10f etc) or "
"``SPHERICAL`` (5d, 7f etc) can be chosen using ``ATTRIBUTE``. By default, "
"the same type as for the orbital basis is used. Normally, ``SPHERICAL`` is "
"used and recommended. Density fitting with CARTESIAN is limited to "
"g-functions in the orbital basis. Furthermore, density fitting with "
"CARTESIAN is much slower than with SPHERICAL."
msgstr ""
"可选地，可以使用 ``ATTRIBUTE`` 选择基函数类型 ``CARTESIAN``\\ （6d、10f 等）或 ``SPHERICAL``\\ "
"（5d、7f 等）。默认情况下，使用与轨道基组相同的类型。通常，使用并推荐 ``SPHERICAL``\\ 。使用 CARTESIAN "
"的密度拟合仅限于轨道基组中的 g 函数。此外，使用 CARTESIAN 的密度拟合比使用 SPHERICAL 慢得多。"

msgid ""
"Specific basis sets for individual atoms or explicit input of exponents and "
"contraction coefficients can be given exactly in the same way as for orbital"
" basis sets."
msgstr "针对单个原子的特定基组或指数和收缩系数的显式输入，可以完全按照与轨道基组相同的方式给出。"

msgid "Primitive set definition"
msgstr "原始集合定义"

msgid ""
"Default basis sets given using one-line ``BASIS`` commands or ``DEFAULT`` "
"directives in a basis block can be overwritten by explicit specifications of"
" basis functions (type, exponents, contraction coefficients)."
msgstr ""
"使用单行 ``BASIS`` 命令或基组块中的 ``DEFAULT`` 指令给出的默认基组，可以通过显式指定基函数（类型、指数、收缩系数）来覆盖。"

msgid ""
"A group of basis functions is defined by a data card specifying a set of "
"primitive gaussians, optionally followed by one or more cards specifying "
"particular contractions of primitives to be included in the final basis (see"
" section `contracted set definitions <basis_input.html#contracted-set-"
"definitions>`__ for specification of contractions)."
msgstr ""
"一组基函数由一个指定一组原始高斯函数的数据卡片定义，可选地后跟一个或多个卡片，指定要包含在最终基组中的原始函数的特定收缩（有关收缩的规范，请参见 "
"`收缩集合定义 <basis_input.html#contracted-set-definitions>`__ 部分）。"

msgid ""
"If an individual basis function type (:math:`s`, :math:`p`, :math:`d`, etc.)"
" is specified for an atom, it is required that all other types are also "
"defined, i.e., as soon as an explicit definition of a basis function for an "
"atom is given, all defaults are erased for this atom."
msgstr ""
"如果为某个原子指定了单个基函数类型（\\ :math:`s`\\ 、\\ :math:`p`\\ 、\\ :math:`d` "
"等），则要求所有其他类型也必须被定义。也就是说，一旦给出了某个原子的基函数的显式定义，该原子的所有默认设置都将被清除。"

msgid ""
"There are four different input forms for basis functions, as explained below"
" under a) to d). In case that options (e.g. ``SCALE``, ``NPRIM``) are "
"specified, they can be given in any order, but no value without option key "
"must be given after an option."
msgstr ""
"基函数有四种不同的输入形式，如下文 a) 至 d) 所述。如果指定了选项（例如 ``SCALE``\\ 、\\ ``NPRIM``\\ "
"），它们可以按任意顺序给出，但在一个选项之后不能给出不带选项键的值。"

msgid ""
"In all four cases *type* defines the angular symmetry (``S, P, D, F, G, H,``"
" or ``I``). *type* can include several types, e.g., ``SPD`` or ``DF`` (this "
"usually makes sense only with default library contractions or no "
"contractions). The basis is loaded for all atoms with tag name *atom* in the"
" geometry input. If *atom* is an integer, it refers to a z-matrix row."
msgstr ""
"在所有四种情况下，\\ *type* 定义了角对称性（\\ ``S, P, D, F, G, H,`` 或 ``I``\\ ）。\\ *type* "
"可以包含多种类型，例如 ``SPD`` 或 ``DF``\\ （这通常仅在默认库收缩或无收缩时才有意义）。该基组将加载到几何输入中所有标签名为 "
"*atom* 的原子上。如果 *atom* 是整数，则它引用 Z-矩阵中的一行。"

msgid "Library basis sets:"
msgstr "库基组："

msgid "*type,atom,name,scale2,nprim*;"
msgstr "*type,atom,name,scale2,nprim*;"

msgid "Load basis named *name* from the library."
msgstr "从库中加载名为 *name* 的基组。"

msgid "Explicit basis input:"
msgstr "显式基组输入："

msgid "*type,atom,exp1,exp2,*\\ :math:`\\ldots`\\ *expn;expn+1,*\\ :math:`\\ldots`;"
msgstr "*type,atom,exp1,exp2,*\\ :math:`\\ldots`\\ *expn;expn+1,*\\ :math:`\\ldots`;"

msgid ""
"General specification of exponents; continuation onto subsequent cards "
"(separated by semicolon) is permitted as shown (the first card can hold up "
"to 19 exponents, each following card 20 exponents)."
msgstr "指数的通用规范；允许如所示方式延续到后续卡片（以分号分隔）（第一张卡片最多可容纳19个指数，后续每张卡片20个指数）。"

msgid ""
"The exponents (and other numerical parameters described below such as "
"numbers of functions, and contraction coefficients) can be given as general "
"input expressions, possibly involving variables. It is important to note, "
"however, that these expressions are evaluated typically just once, at the "
"same time as the complete basis set is parsed. This generally happens the "
"first time that the basis set is required, perhaps before the first SCF "
"calculation can be done. If the variables on which the basis depends are "
"altered, this will not be noticed by the program, and the new basis set will"
" not be used for subsequent stages of the computation. If, however, a new "
"basis block is presented in the input, then the program marks as outdated "
"any quantities such as integrals that have been calculated with the old "
"basis set; subsequent job steps will then use the new basis."
msgstr ""
"指数（以及下文描述的其他数值参数，如函数数量和收缩系数）可以作为通用输入表达式给出，可能涉及变量。然而，需要注意的是，这些表达式通常只计算一次，即在完整基组被解析的同时。这通常发生在第一次需要基组时，可能在第一次SCF计算能够进行之前。如果基组所依赖的变量被更改，程序将不会注意到，并且新的基组将不会用于后续的计算阶段。但是，如果在输入中呈现了一个新的基组块，则程序会将使用旧基组计算的任何量（例如积分）标记为过时；后续的作业步骤将使用新的基组。"

msgid "Even tempered basis sets:"
msgstr "均匀调谐基组："

msgid ""
"\\log e_i =\n"
"\\log c\n"
"+ ((n+1)/2-i) \\,\\log r\n"
"+ \\frac12 ((n+1)/2-i)^2 \\,\\log d\n"
"\\quad\n"
"i=1,2,\\dots,n"
msgstr ""
"\\log e_i =\n"
"\\log c\n"
"+ ((n+1)/2-i) \\,\\log r\n"
"+ \\frac12 ((n+1)/2-i)^2 \\,\\log d\n"
"\\quad\n"
"i=1,2,\\dots,n"

msgid "3-term tempered basis sets:"
msgstr "三项调谐基组："

msgid ""
"Generates a 3-parameter set of *nprim* functions with exponents given by"
msgstr "生成一个 *nprim* 个函数的三参数集合，其指数由下式给出"

msgid ""
"e_0 = \\alpha ; \\qquad e_i=e_{i-1} \\,\\beta \\left(1+\\frac{\\gamma \\cdot i^2}{( { {nprim}}+1)^2}\\right)\n"
", \\quad i=1,\\dots  {{nprim}}-1"
msgstr ""
"e_0 = \\alpha ; \\qquad e_i=e_{i-1} \\,\\beta \\left(1+\\frac{\\gamma \\cdot i^2}{( { {nprim}}+1)^2}\\right)\n"
", \\quad i=1,\\dots  {{nprim}}-1"

msgid "Regular even tempered basis sets:"
msgstr "常规偶调谐基组："

msgid ""
"Generates an even tempered set of *nprim* functions according to the "
"“regular” prescription described in M W Schmidt and K Ruedenberg, `J. Chem. "
"Phys. <https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.438165>`__ **71**, 3951 (1970). If any "
"of the parameters *aa, ap, bb, bp* is zero or omitted, the values are taken "
"from table III of the above."
msgstr ""
"根据 M W Schmidt 和 K Ruedenberg 在 `J. Chem. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.438165>`__ **71**, 3951 (1970) "
"中描述的“常规”方案，生成一个包含 *nprim* 个函数的偶调基组。如果参数 *aa, ap, bb, bp* 中任何一个为零或省略，则从上述文献的表"
" III 中取值。"

msgid "Even tempered basis set with confined progression:"
msgstr "具有受限递进的偶调基组："

msgid ""
"Generates an even tempered basis set with *nprim* functions and a maximal "
"exponent given by :math:`\\alpha`. The progression (ratio) between the first"
" and second exponent is adjusted using parameter :math:`\\beta` and the "
"progression between the last but one and the last exponent is adjusted with "
"parameter :math:`\\gamma`. In between the progression is linearly "
"interpolated. The explicit values of the progression factors are given by:"
msgstr ""
"生成一个具有 *nprim* 个函数的偶调基组，其最大指数由 :math:`\\alpha` 给出。第一个和第二个指数之间的递进（比率）使用参数 "
":math:`\\beta` 调整，倒数第二个和最后一个指数之间的递进使用参数 :math:`\\gamma` "
"调整。中间的递进是线性插值的。递进因子的具体值由下式给出："

msgid ""
"so that for :math:`\\beta \\ll 0: p \\rightarrow \\sqrt{2}` and for "
":math:`\\beta \\gg 0: p \\rightarrow 5+\\sqrt{2}` which limits the "
"progression factors in between these two values and enables unconstrained "
"basis set optimisations. For :math:`\\beta \\approx 0` the progression has a"
" factor of about 2."
msgstr ""
"因此，当 :math:`\\beta \\ll 0: p \\rightarrow \\sqrt{2}` 且当 :math:`\\beta \\gg "
"0: p \\rightarrow 5+\\sqrt{2}`\\ ，这限制了递进因子在这两个值之间，并允许无约束的基组优化。当 "
":math:`\\beta \\approx 0` 时，递进因子约为 2。"

msgid ""
"Generalises confined progression tempered basis sets by a third parameter "
"(now :math:`\\gamma`) which defines the progression as above in the centre. "
"The ratio factors are then determined by interpolating between "
":math:`p(\\beta)\\rightarrow p(\\gamma)` and :math:`p(\\gamma)\\rightarrow "
"p(\\delta)`."
msgstr ""
"通过引入第三个参数（现为 :math:`\\gamma`\\ ）来推广受限递进调谐基组，该参数在中心区域按上述方式定义递进关系。比例因子随后通过在 "
":math:`p(\\beta)\\rightarrow p(\\gamma)` 和 :math:`p(\\gamma)\\rightarrow "
"p(\\delta)` 之间插值确定。"

msgid "Contracted set definitions"
msgstr "收缩集定义"

msgid ""
"General specification of a contracted function. *first.last* defines the "
"range of primitives to be contracted. The order corresponds to the "
"primitives as specified on the previous input card. *c1, c2*\\ "
":math:`\\ldots` are the :math:`last-first+1` contraction coefficients. "
"Continuation onto a subsequent card is permitted as shown."
msgstr ""
"收缩函数的一般规范。\\ *first.last* 定义了待收缩的原始函数范围。顺序对应于前一张输入卡片上指定的原始函数。\\ *c1, c2*\\ "
":math:`\\ldots` 是 :math:`last-first+1` 个收缩系数。允许如所示延续到后续卡片上。"

msgid ""
"Use default contractions from the library. This applies to both the number "
"of contracted primitives and also to the number of different contraction "
"sets."
msgstr "使用库中的默认收缩。这既适用于收缩的原始函数数量，也适用于不同收缩集的数量。"

msgid ""
":math:`n` contracted functions taken from library. *first.last* defines the "
"range of primitives to be contracted. If :math:`n` is omitted and "
"*first.last* is specified, :math:`n=1`. If *first.last* is omitted, the "
"library default values are used. If both :math:`n` and *first.last* are "
"omitted, default values for both are used."
msgstr ""
":math:`n` 个收缩函数取自库。\\ *first.last* 定义了要收缩的原始函数范围。如果省略 :math:`n` 但指定了 "
"*first.last*\\ ，则 :math:`n=1`\\ 。如果省略 *first.last*\\ ，则使用库的默认值。如果同时省略 "
":math:`n` 和 *first.last*\\ ，则使用两者的默认值。"

msgid ""
":math:`n` contracted functions taken from orbitals *orb*, "
":math:`orb+1`,..,\\ :math:`orb+n-1` of symmetry *sym* on molpro file "
"*record.file*. The first nonzero coefficient in the specified orbital "
"corresponds to the first associated basis function. *first.last* specifies "
"the range of primitives to be contracted. If *first.last* is omitted, all "
"coefficients from the specified orbitals are used."
msgstr ""
":math:`n` 个收缩函数取自 Molpro 文件 *record.file* 上对称性 *sym* 的轨道 *orb*, "
":math:`orb+1`,..,\\ :math:`orb+n-1`\\ 。指定轨道中第一个非零系数对应于第一个关联的基函数。\\ "
"*first.last* 指定了要收缩的原始函数范围。如果省略 *first.last*\\ ，则使用指定轨道中的所有系数。"

msgid "Examples"
msgstr "示例"

msgid "This shows the use of default basis sets for H\\ :math:`_2`\\ O:"
msgstr "此示例展示了 H\\ :math:`_2`\\ O 默认基组的使用："

msgid "This is equivalent to the explicit input form"
msgstr "这等价于显式输入形式"

msgid ""
"The following example shows how to use two different basis sets for the same"
" element:"
msgstr "以下示例展示了如何对同一元素使用两种不同的基组："

msgid ""
"The following example shows how to code the vtz basis set explicitly "
"(exponents + contraction):"
msgstr "以下示例展示了如何显式编写 vtz 基组（指数 + 收缩）："

msgid ""
"See `basis sets for explicitly correlated methods "
"<explicitly_correlated_methods.html#basis-sets>`__ for examples when using "
"explicitly correlated methods."
msgstr ""
"有关使用显式相关方法时的示例，请参阅 `显式相关方法的基组 "
"<explicitly_correlated_methods.html#basissets>`__\\ 。"

msgid ""
"Basis functions are used in Molpro not just for representing orbitals, but "
"also for providing auxiliary sets for density fitting (see :doc:`density "
"fitting <density_fitting>`) and for simplifying integrals through "
"approximate identity resolution in explicitly-correlated methods (see "
":doc:`explicitly correlated methods <explicitly_correlated_methods>`). In "
"order to accommodate this, the program maintains internally a number of "
"different *sets*. The first of these always has the name ``ORBITAL`` and is "
"the primary basis set for representing orbitals, and others can be defined "
"as necessary as described below, or else are constructed automatically by "
"the program when required. In the latter case, the density-fitting and other"
" modules attempt to guess a reasonable library fitting basis that should be "
"appropriate for the orbital basis set; it is advisable to check the choice "
"when using anything other than a standard orbital basis set."
msgstr ""
"在 Molpro 中，基函数不仅用于表示轨道，还用于为密度拟合提供辅助基组（参见 :doc:`密度拟合 <density_fitting>`\\ "
"），以及在显式相关方法中通过近似恒等分辨来简化积分（参见 :doc:`显式相关方法 <explicitly_correlated_methods>`\\"
" ）。为了满足这一需求，程序在内部维护了若干不同的\\ *集合*\\ 。其中第一个集合的名称始终为 ``ORBITAL``\\ "
"，是用于表示轨道的主基组；其他集合可以根据需要按下文所述进行定义，或者在需要时由程序自动构建。在后一种情况下，密度拟合模块及其他模块会尝试猜测一个合理的库拟合基组，该基组应当适用于当前轨道基组；当使用非标准轨道基组时，建议检查这一选择。"

msgid "the basis sets are larger and more linearly dependent;"
msgstr "基组更大，线性相关性更强；"

msgid ""
"density fitting routines are much slower with cartesian basis functions than"
" with spherical harmonics;"
msgstr "对于笛卡尔基函数，密度拟合例程比使用球谐函数时慢得多；"

msgid ""
"some programs cannot use cartesian basis functions at all, e.g. the PNO "
"programs, gradients with density fitting, or F12 calculations."
msgstr "某些程序完全无法使用笛卡尔基函数，例如 PNO 程序、带密度拟合的梯度计算或 F12 计算。"

msgid "``set, name, context=jkfit, [attributes=]cartesian\\\\`` \\...."
msgstr "``set, name, context=jkfit, [attributes=]cartesian\\\\`` \\..."

msgid ""
"Many of the basis sets are taken directly from the Basis Set Exchange  "
"`database <https://www.basissetexchange.org>`__, but there are others, "
"notably the Stuttgart `effective core potentials and bases "
"<http://www.tc.uni-koeln.de/PP/index.en.html>`__ and Grant Hill's database "
"for correlation consistent basis sets, `ccRepo <http://www.grant-"
"hill.group.shef.ac.uk/ccrepo>`__."
msgstr ""
"许多基组直接取自 Basis Set Exchange  `database "
"<https://www.basissetexchange.org>`__\\ ，但也有一些来自其他来源，特别是 Stuttgart 的 "
"`effective core potentials and bases <http://www.tc.uni-"
"koeln.de/PP/index.en.html>`__ 以及 Grant Hill 的 correlation consistent 基组数据库 "
"`ccRepo <http://www.grant-hill.group.shef.ac.uk/ccrepo>`__\\ 。"

msgid "``BASIS,basis``"
msgstr "``BASIS,basis``"

msgid "``BASIS=basis``"
msgstr "``BASIS=basis``"

msgid ""
"The Binning/Curtiss sets for Ga–Kr (``BINNING-SV``, ``BINNING-SVP``, "
"``BINNING-VTZ`` and ``BINNING-VTZP``)"
msgstr ""
"用于 Ga–Kr 的 Binning/Curtiss 集合（\\ ``BINNING-SV``\\ 、\\ ``BINNING-SVP``\\ 、\\ "
"``BINNING-VTZ`` 和 ``BINNING-VTZP``\\ ）"

