msgid "``basis,default=awcvtz,h=vtz,b-cl=avtz``"
msgstr "``basis,default=awcvtz,h=vtz,b-cl=avtz``"

msgid ""
"If the setnames are ``JFIT``, ``JKFIT``, ``MP2FIT``, ``CCSDFIT``, ``OPTRI`` "
"and/or ``CABS`` , these basis are used automatically all programs where "
"needed (unless different basis sets are defined in the input for these "
"programs). Note, however, that this is not the case if  different names "
"(e.g. JK) are used. In this case one would need to give, for example,"
msgstr ""
"如果集合名称为 ``JFIT``\\ 、\\ ``JKFIT``\\ 、\\ ``MP2FIT``\\ 、\\ ``CCSDFIT``\\ 、\\ "
"``OPTRI`` 和/或 ``CABS``\\ "
"，则在所有需要这些基组的程序中会自动使用它们（除非在这些程序的输入中定义了不同的基组）。但请注意，如果使用了不同的名称（例如 "
"JK），则情况并非如此。此时需要给出例如："

msgid ""
"``SET``,\\ *name*,[``CONTEXT=``\\ *context*] where *name* is an arbitrary "
"name that can be used later to choose the basis set using options like "
"``df_basis=``\\ *name*, ``ri_basis=``\\ *name* etc. ``CONTEXT`` can "
"optionally be specified to select the basis types ``JFIT``, ``JKFIT``, "
"``MP2FIT``, ``CCSDFIT``, ``OPTRI``, or ``CABS``. This affects the choice of "
"default basis sets. For example"
msgstr ""
"``SET``,\\ *name*,[``CONTEXT=``\\ *context*]，其中 *name* 是任意名称，之后可通过 "
"``df_basis=``\\ *name*\\ 、\\ ``ri_basis=``\\ *name* 等选项使用该名称来选择基组。可以选择性地指定 "
"``CONTEXT``\\ ，以选择基组类型 ``JFIT``\\ 、\\ ``JKFIT``\\ 、\\ ``MP2FIT``\\ 、\\ "
"``CCSDFIT``\\ 、\\ ``OPTRI`` 或 ``CABS``\\ 。这会影响默认基组的选择。例如"

msgid ""
"If the setname begins with ``JFIT``, ``JKFIT``, ``MP2FIT``, ``CCSDFIT``, "
"``OPTRI``, or ``CABS``, these strings define the default context. If the "
"setnames correspond exactly to the context name, the corresponding sets are "
"used automatically where needed (e.g. ``JKFIT`` in DF-HF and ``MP2FIT`` in "
"DF-MP2)."
msgstr ""
"如果集合名称以 ``JFIT``\\ 、\\ ``JKFIT``\\ 、\\ ``MP2FIT``\\ 、\\ ``CCSDFIT``\\ 、\\ "
"``OPTRI`` 或 ``CABS`` 开头，则这些字符串定义了默认上下文。如果集合名称与上下文名称完全对应，则在需要时自动使用相应的集合（例如 "
"DF-HF 中的 ``JKFIT`` 和 DF-MP2 中的 ``MP2FIT``\\ ）。"

msgid ""
"If individual basis functions are specified, and \"+\" is given before the "
"type (e.g. ``+S``, ``+P``) these functions are added to an existing default "
"basis (only with molpro2026.1 or later)."
msgstr ""
"如果指定了单个基函数，并且在类型前给出“+”（例如 ``+S``\\ 、\\ ``+P``\\ ），则将这些函数添加到已有的默认基组中（仅限 "
"molpro2026.1 或更高版本）。"

msgid ""
"``type,atom,name,[SCALE=scale$|$SCALE2=scale2],[NPRIM=nprim$|$DELETE=ndel];``"
msgstr ""
"``type,atom,name,[SCALE=scale$|$SCALE2=scale2],[NPRIM=nprim$|$DELETE=ndel];``"

msgid ""
"If ``SCALE`` or ``SCALE2`` is present, all exponents are scaled by *scale* "
"or *scale\\*\\*2*, respectively. If ``NPRIM`` is specified, the first "
"*nprim* exponents only are taken from the library. If *nprim* is negative or"
" ``DELETE=``\\ *ndel* is given, the last :math:`|nprim|` (:math:`ndel`) "
"basis functions from the library set are deleted. In these cases only a "
"single angular momentum (e.g. *s* or *p*) is allowed in *type*. Associated "
"with the library basis may be a set of default contraction coefficients "
"which may be accessed in subsequent contraction cards. *type* can include "
"several types, e.g., ``SPD`` or ``DF``. This usually makes sense only with "
"default contractions, i.e., such cards should be followed only by “\\ "
"``C``\\ ” without any other specifications for contractions."
msgstr ""
"如果存在 ``SCALE`` 或 ``SCALE2``\\ ，则所有指数分别乘以 *scale* 或 *scale\\*\\*2*\\ 。如果指定了 "
"``NPRIM``\\ ，则仅从库中取前 *nprim* 个指数。如果 *nprim* 为负或给定了 ``DELETE=``\\ *ndel*\\ "
"，则删除库集合中最后 :math:`|nprim|`\\ （\\ :math:`ndel`\\ ）个基函数。在这些情况下，\\ *type* "
"中只允许单一角动量（例如 *s* 或 *p*\\ ）。与库基组相关联的可以是一组默认收缩系数，这些系数可在后续的收缩卡片中访问。\\ *type* "
"可以包含多个类型，例如 ``SPD`` 或 ``DF``\\ 。这通常仅在使用默认收缩时才有意义，即此类卡片后面应只跟“\\ ``C``\\ "
"”，而不要对收缩作任何其他指定。"

msgid ""
"If \"+\" is given before the type (e.g. +s, +p) these functions are added to"
" a previously defined default basis."
msgstr "如果在类型前给出“+”（例如 +s、+p），则将这些函数添加到先前定义的默认基组中。"

msgid "``type,atom,EVEN,nprim,ratio,centre,dratio``"
msgstr "``type,atom,EVEN,nprim,ratio,centre,dratio``"

msgid ""
"``type,atom,EVEN,NPRIM=nprim,[RATIO=ratio],[CENTRE=centre],[DRATIO=dratio]``"
msgstr ""
"``type,atom,EVEN,NPRIM=nprim,[RATIO=ratio],[CENTRE=centre],[DRATIO=dratio]``"

msgid ""
"Generates a generalized even tempered set of functions. The number of "
"functions :math:`n` is specified by *nprim*, their geometric mean :math:`c` "
"by *centre*, the mean ratio of successive exponents :math:`r` by *ratio*, "
"and the variation of this ratio, :math:`d`, by *dratio*. If *centre* is not "
"given, the previous basis of the same type is extended by diffuse functions."
" This also holds if a default basis has been specified (only with "
"molpro2026.1 or later). If in this case *ratio* is not given, :math:`r` is "
"determined from the exponents of the last two function of the previous "
"basis. If this is not possible, the default :math:`r=2.5` is adopted. "
":math:`d=1` (the default) specifies a true even-tempered set, but otherwise "
"the ratio between successive exponents changes linearly; the exponents are "
"given explicitly by"
msgstr ""
"生成一组广义 even tempered 函数。函数个数 :math:`n` 由 *nprim* 指定，其几何平均 :math:`c` 由 "
"*centre* 指定，相邻指数之比的均值 :math:`r` 由 *ratio* 指定，该比值的变化 :math:`d` 由 *dratio* "
"指定。如果未给出 *centre*\\ ，则通过添加弥散函数来扩展同类型的先前基组。如果已指定默认基组，这也成立（仅限 molpro2026.1 "
"或更高版本）。在这种情况下，如果未给出 *ratio*\\ ，则由先前基组最后两个函数的指数确定 :math:`r`\\ 。如果无法确定，则采用默认值 "
":math:`r=2.5`\\ 。\\ :math:`d=1`\\ （默认值）表示真正的 even-tempered "
"集合，否则相邻指数之间的比值线性变化；指数由下式显式给出："

msgid "**Example 1** ``SP,1,VTZ;C;SP,1,EVEN,1;``"
msgstr "**示例 1** ``SP,1,VTZ;C;SP,1,EVEN,1;``"

msgid ""
"generates the generally contracted :math:`s` and :math:`p` triple-zeta basis"
" sets for atom 1 and extends these by one diffuse function."
msgstr "为原子 1 生成广义收缩的 :math:`s` 和 :math:`p` 三ζ基组，并通过一个弥散函数对其进行扩展。"

msgid "**Example 2** ``SPD,1,VTZ,DELETE=1;C; SP,1,EVEN,NPRIM=2,RATIO=2.5;``"
msgstr "**示例 2** ``SPD,1,VTZ,DELETE=1;C; SP,1,EVEN,NPRIM=2,RATIO=2.5;``"

msgid ""
"generates the generally contracted :math:`s`, :math:`p` triple-zeta basis "
"sets for atom 1. Two energy optimized :math:`d`-functions of Dunning are "
"included. The last :math:`s` and :math:`p` functions are deleted and "
"replaced by two even tempered functions with ratio 2.5."
msgstr ""
"为原子 1 生成广义收缩的 :math:`s`\\ 、\\ :math:`p` 三ζ基组。其中包含两个 Dunning 的能量优化 :math:`d` "
"函数。最后一个 :math:`s` 和 :math:`p` 函数被删除，并由两个比值为 2.5 的 even tempered 函数取代。"

